  "created": "2026-07-20T15:46:52.037Z",
  "description": "A comprehensive .NET library for parsing, rendering, creating, editing, optimizing, and validating PDF documents. Pure C# implementation with no native or third-party codec dependencies; cross-platform on .NET 8, 9, and 10. Supports PDF 1.x and 2.0, and includes a read-only conformance preflight for PDF/A (2b/2u/3b), PDF/X-4, and PDF/UA-1.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Lxman.PdfLibrary",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-20T15:50:31.01Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "rzuy7+rmSWdH1ROPAEki37x7x3fQzgMQODZnkW38O+8i7nNYEtQlvaMW1NlaHEPdCU+L1DJ//obJVjDSuNKI+A==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 2893934,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/lxman/PdfLibrary",
  "published": "2026-07-20T15:46:52.037Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.5.0 adds a public embedded-files read API: PdfDocument.GetEmbeddedFiles() returns read-only EmbeddedFileDescriptor entries for the catalog's /Names /EmbeddedFiles name tree plus catalog-level /AF associated files (ISO 32000-2, 7.11.4 / 14.13) — names, file names, description, MIME subtype, associated-file relationship, and the decoded file bytes. Malformed content never throws; failing entries degrade to metadata-only. First consumer: Factur-X e-invoice extraction (factur-x.xml from PDF/A-3).\n\n2.4.0 adds a read-only conformance preflight (PDF/A-2b/2u/3b, PDF/X-4, PDF/UA-1) via PdfLibrary.Conformance.Preflighter, plus a CMYK / colour-managed rendering fidelity batch (Ghent Workgroup fixtures), 16-bit images, optional-content visibility, mesh shadings, a transparency-group render SPI, and text-extraction fixes. Additive and back-compatible. See CHANGELOG.md.",
